{"product":{"id":10627115745619,"title":"Paul Mitchell MITCH Construction Paste Flexible Styling Paste","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eBuild your look\u003c\/b\u003e with this \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eflexible styling paste\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e that lets you easily reshape hair without flaking or leaving behind residue.\u003cbr\u003eThe formula helps form, separate and define hair with \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003emedium hold\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e and a \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003elow-shine finish\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e. It is ideal for messy, textured styles and for defining waves and curls, while keeping hair soft and manageable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eHair Type:\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"p2\"\u003eFor all hair types, especially short to medium lengths\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eBenefits:\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"p2\"\u003eForms, separates and defines hair\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"p2\"\u003eProvides medium hold with a low-shine finish\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"p2\"\u003eCreates crunch-free, flake-free styles\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"p2\"\u003eLeaves hair soft and manageable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"p2\"\u003eSuitable for short to medium lengths\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"p2\"\u003eColor-safe formula\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"p2\"\u003eVegan\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"p2\"\u003eParaben-free\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"p2\"\u003eMade without gluten\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eHow to Use:\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003eActivate by vigorously working paste into hands, then distribute through damp or dry hair\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eIngredients:\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003eThe flexible, mesh-like formula in Construction Paste helps \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eshape and reshape hair\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e, providing \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003emedium hold\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e and a \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003elow-shine finish\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e without crunch or flakes\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Rempire Tower Shop","product_type":"styling paste","created_at":"2026-06-04T22:45:39+03:00","handle":"paul-mitchell-mitch-construction-paste-flexible-styling-paste","updated_at":"2026-09-02T13:03:22+03:00","published_at":"2026-06-04T23:09:50+03:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"Flexible-Hold, Low-Shine, Messy-Look, new, Paul Mitchell, Texture","variants":[{"id":53927005684051,"product_id":10627115745619,"title":"75 ml","price":"23.00","sku":null,"position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"75 ml","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2026-06-04T22:45:40+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-02T13:03:22+03:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"NA","grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0.0,"weight_unit":"kg","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"EUR","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_price_breaks":[]}],"options":[{"id":13406497014099,"product_id":10627115745619,"name":"Size","position":1,"values":["75 ml"]}],"images":[{"id":77378361459027,"product_id":10627115745619,"position":1,"created_at":"2026-06-04T22:45:52+03:00","updated_at":"2026-06-04T23:14:15+03:00","alt":null,"width":1775,"height":1436,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0607\/8555\/7760\/files\/PMConstructionPaste_webp.jpg?v=1780604055","variant_ids":[]}],"image":{"id":77378361459027,"product_id":10627115745619,"position":1,"created_at":"2026-06-04T22:45:52+03:00","updated_at":"2026-06-04T23: